Undercurrent web UI
==================

web/viewer/ is derived from the Headlong project:
  https://github.com/laude-institute/headlong  (web/viewer)
  Copyright the Headlong authors.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see web/LICENSE).

The vendored React viewer (app code, routes, components, client-side models,
styling) is unmodified except:
  - viewer/vite.config.ts  : added a dev-server /api proxy to the TS data layer
  - viewer/package.json    : npm-based scripts

web/server/ is new code written for the Undercurrent port. Each module documents
the upstream Python module it ports from headlong/web/src/headlong_web/*.py
(also Apache-2.0).
